speechtext:
My hon. friend is under a misapprehension. I took that matter up personally with the authorities at Washington and went into it very thoroughly. We had that embargo lifted some time ago, adopted a position which would allow any of our potatoes to come in as- long as they had not more than, a certain percentage-
145}
I have forgotten the exact percentage-of disease, including povfdery scab and other diseases of less importance. Therefore, there has been practically free importation of potatoes into that country for some time past. We advise the United States authorities from time to time of conditions in this country.
